# The 4 pickled artifacts (finbert_pca, symbol_encoder, feature_columns,
# xgboost_model) live in artifacts/ and are required for the Docker build and
# to run the service. They are small (~1.5MB total) and tracked in Git so the
# repo is self-contained and reproducible. If the team versions them with DVC
# instead, ignore them here and `dvc pull` before building.
